  era: "c. 2600\u20131900 BCE \xB7 Section 2 \xB7 Indus Valley Civilisation \xB7 c. 3300 \u2013 1300 BCE (mature phase c. 2600 \u2013 1900 BCE)"
  title: Major Harappan cities
  text: 'More than a thousand Harappan sites are known, but a few large cities stand out: Harappa, Mohenjo-daro and Ganweriwala in Pakistan, and Dholavira, Rakhigarhi, Lothal and Kalibangan in India.'
